# Splunk App Conventions

- App id: `agent_smith` under `splunk_app/agent_smith/`
- No secrets in `default/` — use `local/` or `passwords.conf` at runtime
- Capabilities: `agent_smith_use`, `agent_smith_admin`
- Install target: `/opt/splunk/etc/apps/agent_smith`
- Sidecar default: `http://127.0.0.1:8787`
